      ],
      "source": "https://www.oldsaybrookct.gov/159/Our-History"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Continental glaciers most recently shaped the landscape of Old Saybrook approximately twenty-two thousand years ago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
